You are so full with power that it overflows out of you whenever you cast a spell.

Upon spell cast you have [8%, 13%, 18%, 21%, 25% (TL1-5)] chances to boost the physical power, spellpower, mindpower and all saves of all friendly undeads in sight (including yourself) by [10, 23, 33, 42, 50 (TL1-5)] for 4 turns.
